{"id":"cf7556ed0c4a1be8","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Continuous Poset","display":"df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset — ZFC Order12 Continuous Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset","58-df-zfc-order9-continuous-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset — ZFC Order12 Continuous Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset</span><span>58-df-zfc-order9-continuous-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset — ZFC Order12 Continuous Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9611c23f91c8d5e4\" href=\"?note=9611c23f91c8d5e4\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (directed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9611c23f91c8d5e4\" href=\"?note=9611c23f91c8d5e4\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ContinuousPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ContinuousPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ContinuousPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\to\n\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}{}\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists B\\subseteq P\\;\\Biggl(\nB=\\Biggl\\{y\\in P\\;\\Biggm|\\;\n\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\land\\langle x,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle y,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(B,\\leq_P\\cap(B\\times B))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(\\langle b,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}{}\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall b\\in B\\;(\\langle b,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ContinuousPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\to\n\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}{}\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists B\\subseteq P\\;\\Biggl(\nB=\\Biggl\\{y\\in P\\;\\Biggm|\\;\n\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\land\\langle x,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle y,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(B,\\leq_P\\cap(B\\times B))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(\\langle b,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}{}\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall b\\in B\\;(\\langle b,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first quantified clause is directed completeness.  The set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> in the second clause is the set of elements way below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>, required to be directed with supremum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The order9 continuous-poset variant is treated as an alias of this predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9611c23f91c8d5e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9611c23f91c8d5e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (directed-set predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ContinuousPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ContinuousPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\to\n\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\\\\n&\\hspace{45mm}{}\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists B\\subseteq P\\;\\Biggl(\nB=\\Biggl\\{y\\in P\\;\\Biggm|\\;\n\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\\\\n&\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\land\\langle x,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\\\\n&\\hspace{27mm}{}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle y,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{15mm}{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(B,\\leq_P\\cap(B\\times B))\n\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;(\\langle b,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\\\\n&\\hspace{15mm}{}\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall b\\in B\\;(\\langle b,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\to\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":2331,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2905","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset.md|58-df-zfc-order12-continuous-poset]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5","9611c23f91c8d5e4"]}